// libpng 1.6.59 (conan-center-index recipes/libpng). Every clause cites
// include/png.h installed by the package.
//
// Raw functions (genuinely unmodeled/unsafe by nature):
// - png_set_longjmp_fn, png_longjmp: C setjmp/longjmp non-local jump buffers
//   (use setjmp-free error handling via png_set_error_fn instead).
// - png_create_read_struct_2, png_create_write_struct_2, png_set_mem_fn,
//   png_get_mem_ptr, png_malloc, png_calloc, png_malloc_warn, png_free,
//   png_malloc_default, png_free_default: custom raw allocator hooks and
//   untyped `void *` allocations.
// - png_set_read_fn, png_set_write_fn, png_get_io_ptr, png_set_progressive_read_fn,
//   png_get_progressive_ptr, png_process_data*, png_progressive_combine_row,
//   png_set_read_user_transform_fn, png_set_write_user_transform_fn,
//   png_set_user_transform_info, png_get_user_transform_ptr,
//   png_set_read_user_chunk_fn, png_get_user_chunk_ptr: raw pointer I/O and
//   transform callback hooks whose signatures pass untyped raw byte pointers.
// - png_read_row, png_write_row, png_read_rows, png_write_rows, png_get_rows,
//   png_set_rows, png_read_png, png_write_png: row/image functions with caller-managed
//   row pointers or implicit rowbytes without info_ptr (use png_read_image /
//   png_write_image with PngInfo instead).
// - png_image_* simplified API: retains raw image/colormap pointers across
//   multi-step opaque control state.
// - Ancillary chunk getters/setters returning borrowed internal struct pointers
//   through `T **` out-parameters (png_get_PLTE, png_get_tRNS, png_get_text,
//   png_get_iCCP, png_get_eXIf*, png_get_sPLT, png_get_unknown_chunks, etc.).
